---
import TalkCards from '../../components/TalkCards.astro';
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { published } from '../../lib/site';

const talks = (await published('talks')).filter((talk) => talk.data.youtubeId && talk.data.eventName === 'Last Friday Talks').reverse();
---

<Page title="Last Friday Talks" wide>
  <main class="home">
    <p>
      Last friday talks were at first internal technical conferences at the end of each month given by Bedrock employees about various subjects.{' '}
      <a href="/organiser-des-conferences-technique-en-interne.html">The concept of LFT has been introduced in this article 🇫🇷.</a>
    </p>
    <p>Since this article, the event has evolved to include non-technical talks. Everyone can share their passion.</p>
    <p>Here are some replays of LFT available on Youtube:</p>
    <TalkCards talks={talks} />
  </main>
</Page>
